{"name": "General Practice", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>PLAY THE DEMO NOW!</i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SURVIVE THE SHIFT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> </strong>You and your buddies clock in for an absolutely completely totally normal day at the GP clinic. The timer is ticking, patients are flooding in, and the waiting room is already full of all sorts of sneezing troublemakers. Just the usual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"490\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833730/extras/9dd178e5134e945506e22a594a510b41.poster.avif?t=1787148277\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833730/extras/9dd178e5134e945506e22a594a510b41.webm?t=1787148277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833730/extras/9dd178e5134e945506e22a594a510b41.mp4?t=1787148277\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DO NO HARM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> </strong>Not every patient makes it out <span class=\"bb_strike\">alive</span>\u00a0happy. Or healthy. But you do your best! Scan, mix, zap, inject, shoot, explode... <i>ahem, I mean...\u00a0</i>contain epidemics and improvise your way through increasingly chaotic conditions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"490\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833730/extras/7e6fe5866dd4961acbad00a3aba57afe.poster.avif?t=1787148277\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833730/extras/7e6fe5866dd4961acbad00a3aba57afe.webm?t=1787148277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833730/extras/7e6fe5866dd4961acbad00a3aba57afe.mp4?t=1787148277\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>RAGE AGAINST THE X-RAY MACHINE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> </strong>Master a growing lineup of more and more elaborate medical contraptions, each with its own quirks and workflows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"460\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833730/extras/f252724c14eea741c2cbce0477d30409.poster.avif?t=1787148277\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833730/extras/f252724c14eea741c2cbce0477d30409.webm?t=1787148277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833730/extras/f252724c14eea741c2cbce0477d30409.mp4?t=1787148277\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FRIENDSHIP IS MAGIC, <i>while it lasts</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> </strong>No one survives the ward alone! Communication, coordination, and yelling directions across the room are the glue that holds friendships together. In case you don't have any friends, don't worry, you'll never work alone: nurse Gary will always lend a helping <i>highly</i>\u00a0<i>competent</i> hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"490\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833730/extras/3f05e0ed5980ea532313a0f0158d6caf.poster.avif?t=1787148277\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833730/extras/3f05e0ed5980ea532313a0f0158d6caf.webm?t=1787148277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833730/extras/3f05e0ed5980ea532313a0f0158d6caf.mp4?t=1787148277\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Treat patients together with up to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Local, online, or mixed co-op (couch + online)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">50+ maps\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many medical devices with different mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique patients with unique quirks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trinkets and equipment upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">High-fives</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"490\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833730/extras/48cfc89bedf55559774db218251454ef.poster.avif?t=1787148277\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833730/extras/48cfc89bedf55559774db218251454ef.webm?t=1787148277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833730/extras/48cfc89bedf55559774db218251454ef.mp4?t=1787148277\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Diagnose and (mis)treat patients to meet tight deadlines and high expectations in this wacky medical co-op adventure. Wear many hats, master numerous tools, multitask, manage the chaos: do no harm by any means necessary! Play solo or with up to 4 friends, locally or online.", "header_image": "https://s